      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IRINKA ALANA (1) has been out of the placings at her last two outings but shapes well for this if she can recapture her blistering win a few runs back, getting around this track over 330m in 18.73. Looks the one to beat on best figures. MY THREE BOYS (7) beaten last start over the 457m at this track but finished in the minors in a slick 25.86. Expecting another bold showing. PITSTONE NICKY (8) goes very well this trip starting eight times for three wins and three minors. In the money last time at this track (26.11) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 8 length third. Looks well placed here and among the chances. NANGAR CHARM (3) has been in the frame at his last two runs, most recently when second (29.95) in a Grade 5 over 520m at Wentworth Park.",
